@using HIDE.RestAndRant.Web_Site_Menu.Models.Cart
@using HIDE.RestAndRant.Web_Site_Menu.Models.Clients
@model Model_Cart_Index
@{
    // Корзина
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
    ViewData["Title"] = "HIDE HIDE - Корзина";
    ViewData["Sidebar"] = "Cart";

    // Получение клиента
    Model_Client? client = Helper_Client.GetClient(Context.User);

    // Получение ресторана
    //Model_Restaurant? restaurant = Helper_Common.GetRestaurant(Context.Request.Cookies[Consts.Cookies_Restaurant]);
}

@* Корзина *@
<main>
    <div class="HIDE-cart">
        @if (Model.List_Dishes != null && Model.List_Dishes.Count != 0)
        {
            <div class="HIDE-common-global">
                <div class="HIDE-cart-content">

                    <div class="HIDE-cart-content-top">

                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-top-left">
                            Столик @Model.RestaurantTableID (зал)
                        </div>

                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-top-right">
                            <button type="button" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#HIDE-cart_clear">
                                Очистить
                            </button>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                    @* Список блюд *@
                    <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list">
                        @foreach (Model_CartItem dish in Model.List_Dishes.OrderByDescending(p => p.ID))
                        {
                            <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem">

                                @* Изображение блюда *@
                                @if (dish.Dish_Image != null)
                                {
                                    <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-img">
                                        <img src="data:image/png;base64,@Convert.ToBase64String(dish.Dish_Image)">
                                    </div>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-img">
                                        <img src="/_i/no_image.png">
                                    </div>
                                }

                                <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right">

                                    @* Название блюда *@
                                    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(dish.Dish_Name))
                                    {
                                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-title">@Html.Raw(dish.Dish_Name)</div>
                                    }


                                    @if (dish.Dish_Ingredient_IDs != null && dish.Dish_Ingredient_IDs.Count != 0)
                                    {
                                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-dop">Есть добавки.</div>
                                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-link">
                                            <a asp-controller="Cart" asp-action="Cart_More" asp-route-DishID="@dish.DishID" asp-route-CartItemID="@dish.ID">
                                                Нажмите, чтобы настроить
                                            </a>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-dop">Без добавок.</div>
                                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-link">
                                            <a asp-controller="Cart" asp-action="Cart_More" asp-route-DishID="@dish.DishID" asp-route-CartItemID="@dish.ID">
                                                Нажмите, чтобы настроить
                                            </a>
                                        </div>
                                    }

                                    <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-block">

                                        <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-block-count">
                                            <button type="button" class="HIDE-js-cart_minus" data-id="@dish.ID" @Html.Raw(dish.Dish_Count > 1 ? "" : "disabled")>
                                                <svg width="16" height="2" viewBox="0 0 16 2" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M0 1.25C0 0.973858 0.223858 0.75 0.5 0.75H15.5C15.7761 0.75 16 0.973858 16 1.25C16 1.52614 15.7761 1.75 15.5 1.75H0.5C0.223858 1.75 0 1.52614 0 1.25Z" fill="white" />
                                                </svg>
                                            </button>
                                            <input readonly="" value="@dish.Dish_Count.ToString("0.##")">
                                            <button type="button" class="HIDE-js-cart_plus" data-id="@dish.ID">
                                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7.25 15.5C7.25 15.7761 7.47386 16 7.75 16C8.02614 16 8.25 15.7761 8.25 15.5V8.75H15.5C15.7761 8.75 16 8.52614 16 8.25C16 7.97386 15.7761 7.75 15.5 7.75H8.25V0.499999C8.25 0.223857 8.02614 0 7.75 0C7.47386 0 7.25 0.223857 7.25 0.499999V7.75H0.5C0.223858 7.75 0 7.97386 0 8.25C0 8.52614 0.223858 8.75 0.5 8.75H7.25V15.5Z" fill="white" />
                                                </svg>
                                            </button>
                                        </div>

                                        @* Цена блюда *@
                                        @if (dish.Sum > 0)
                                        {
                                            <div class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-right-block-price">@Math.Round(HIDE_Convert.ToDecimal(dish.Sum), 0)&nbsp;<text>₽</text></div>
                                        }

                                    </div>

                                </div>

                                @* Кнопка Удалить *@
                                <button class="HIDE-cart-content-list-elem-delete HIDE-js-cart-delete" data-id="@dish.ID" data-dishid="@dish.DishID" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#HIDE-cart_del"></button>

                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>

                </div>

                @* Укажите кол-во гостей *@
                <div class="HIDE-cart-content-HIDEh" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">

                    <div class="HIDE-cart-content-HIDEh-title">
                        Укажите кол-во гостей
                    </div>

                    <div class="HIDE-table-bottom">

                        <div class="HIDE-table-bottom-title">
                            Для правильной сервировки стола
                        </div>

                        <div class="HIDE-table-bottom-input">
                            <input class="HIDE-js-offer_numberQuests" HIDEholder="Количество гостей за столом*" type="text" maxlength="1" />
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                @* Пожелания к заказу *@
                <div class="HIDE-cart-content-HIDEh">

                    <div class="HIDE-cart-content-HIDEh-title">
                        Пожелания к заказу
                    </div>

                    <div class="HIDE-table-bottom">

                        <div class="HIDE-table-bottom-title">
                            Добавить к заказу
                        </div>

                        <div class="HIDE-table-bottom-input">
                            <input class="HIDE-js-offer_add" HIDEholder="Добавить к заказу" type="text" maxlength="75" />
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="HIDE-table-bottom">

                        <div class="HIDE-table-bottom-title">
                            Убрать из заказа
                        </div>

                        <div class="HIDE-table-bottom-input">
                            <input class="HIDE-js-offer_remove" HIDEholder="Убрать с заказа" type="text" maxlength="75" />

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        }
        else
        {
            <div class="HIDE-cart-empty">
                <div class="HIDE-cart-empty_wrapp">
                    <div class="HIDE-cart-empty-top">
                        Столик @Model.RestaurantTableID (зал)
                    </div>

                    <div class="HIDE-cart-empty-title">
                        Добавьте товары в корзину <br />
                        и отправьте заказ Официанту
                    </div>

                    <div class="HIDE-button">
                        <a asp-controller="Menu" asp-action="Menu_Index">Перейти в меню</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    </div>

</main>

@if (Model.List_Dishes != null && Model.List_Dishes.Count != 0 && Model.Sum_Itog.HasValue)
{
    <div class="HIDE-fixed-link">
        <button type="button" class="HIDE-js-cart-offer">
            Отправить заказ официанту - @Model.Sum_Itog.Value.ToString("#,#") ₽
        </button>
    </div>
}

@* Нижняя плашка *@
@* @if (Model.List_Dishes != null && Model.List_Dishes.Count != 0)
{
    <div class="HIDE-fixed-order">

        <div class="HIDE-fixed-order-price">

            <div class="HIDE-fixed-order-price-title">
                @Math.Round(HIDE_Convert.ToDecimal(Model.Sum_Itog), 0) ₽
            </div>

            <div class="HIDE-fixed-order-price-text">
                Итого на сумму
            </div>

        </div>


           <div class="HIDE-fixed-order-button">
                <button type="button" class="HIDE-js-cart-offer">
                    Оформить заказ
                </button>
            </div>

    </div>
} *@

